<title>USA: Clarcor stake cut by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Clarcor stake cut by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Thursday it had cut its stake in Clarcor Inc to 1,654,400 shares, or 11.12 percent, down from 12.18 percent previously.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions included the sale of 12,700 shares Dec 2-3 at prices ranging from $22 to $22.5750 per share.</p>
</text>
